#   request is approved into a second grant
#
# Flips the named test(s).
# APP: samen_core
# TEST_FILES: test/reveal_approver_test.exs
# MUST_FAIL: a stray pending approval of a decided request (data from before the status was written) cannot be approved into a second grant
diff --git a/samen_core/lib/samen/reveal/grants.ex b/samen_core/lib/samen/reveal/grants.ex
index f2445010..be684cf4 100644
